      "value": "ADDITION TO POST:\nFOCUS would make users nameplates appear when you are within a certain radius (close-mid range) and look directly at them. The further away the user are the longer you have to stare at them for their nameplate to show. After looking away the nameplate stays visible for 5-10 seconds and then starts to fade away.",
