  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Adding settings in the ingame menu to turn nameplates locally on - off - fade in - fade out.\nFADE IN would be nameplates disappear in the distance, but gradually become visible within 5-10 meter distance. This would be more immersive for bigger events, where you only really need to know the names of those you are talking to.\nFADE OUT makes nearby players nameplates disappear when they are close to you. The effect could happen after a player has been within 10 meters around you for X units of time. The thought is you would have remembered their avatar and don't need their nameplate anymore, allowing for more immersive interaction.",
